DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     Each device has an enabled flag associated with it.  A device is enabled
     by default when it is created but may be disabled (for instance to pre‐
     vent a destructive or time consuming probe attempt).  To disable a de‐
     vice, call ddeevviiccee__ddiissaabbllee(), to re-enable it, call ddeevviiccee__eennaabbllee() and to
     test to see if a device is enabled, call ddeevviiccee__iiss__eennaabblleedd().

